        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tenzing Norgay, Sir Edmund Hillary, John Hunt\n- Works: Beyond the Edge\n- Events: 1953 ascent of Mount Everest, ninth British expedition to Everest\n- Places: Mount Everest, New Zealand\n\nFacts:\n- In 1953, Tenzing Norgay and Sir Edmund Hillary made a historical ascent of Mount Everest.\n- Tenzing Norgay and Sir Edmund Hillary were part of the ninth British expedition to Everest, which was led by John Hunt.\n- Beyond the Edge is a 2013 New Zealand 3D docudrama about Tenzing Norgay and Sir Edmund Hillary's 1953 ascent of Mount Everest.",
